WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:27.600
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:36.600 --> 01:38.280
Why isn't she back yet?

01:38.360 --> 01:39.760
She's been gone for so long.

01:41.360 --> 01:46.080
ZHENLANG PAVILION

02:03.680 --> 02:06.520
CLEAR MIND

02:12.480 --> 02:13.400
What happened?

02:15.760 --> 02:17.800
Don't wait anymore. Let's go find her.

02:20.720 --> 02:21.840
Su Muzhe's in trouble?

02:22.960 --> 02:24.080
How do you know?

02:25.560 --> 02:28.920
Su Muzhe and Yan Zijing joined forces
to push the Zheng family into such misery.

02:29.000 --> 02:31.240
Do you think Zheng Shiyuan
will swallow his anger?

02:31.320 --> 02:33.680
In broad daylight, would he dare?

02:33.760 --> 02:34.800
Why wouldn't he?

02:34.880 --> 02:37.480
Zheng Shiyuan has always acted
like a law-abiding merchant,

02:37.560 --> 02:39.400
the head of Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

02:39.480 --> 02:41.400
If no one forced his hand,

02:41.920 --> 02:44.000
he wouldn't dare take such bold action.

02:44.680 --> 02:46.560
But Su Muzhe has been gone so long.

02:46.640 --> 02:49.720
If no one goes to look for her,
you might as well prepare for her funeral.

02:51.240 --> 02:53.160
Yingtao, have Gaoshou's people go search!

02:53.240 --> 02:54.640
Quickly!

02:55.680 --> 02:56.560
Thank you.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.040
You're far too kind.

03:10.120 --> 03:12.120
Yan Zijing and Su Muzhe
are our enemies too.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.280
Our real enemy is Zheng Shiyuan.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.800
-Get out! Quickly!
-Hurry up!

03:20.400 --> 03:22.480
Move! Get out!

03:22.560 --> 03:23.520
Hurry!

03:24.160 --> 03:25.280
Who's here?

03:26.320 --> 03:27.320
Ah, Inspector Zhang!

03:29.080 --> 03:31.080
Where is Su Muzhe? Where is Su Muzhe?

03:31.160 --> 03:33.880
Su Muzhe… She's at Clear Mind!

03:33.960 --> 03:35.560
I'm asking you. Where is she?
Where is she?

03:35.640 --> 03:36.640
Stop pressuring me.

03:36.720 --> 03:38.720
Su Muzhe is missing.
How would I know her whereabouts?

03:40.840 --> 03:42.280
I didn't say she was missing.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.400
Zhang Jinran…

03:46.080 --> 03:47.400
Your words alone hold no weight!

03:47.480 --> 03:48.960
You're abusing your power
for personal affairs!

03:50.000 --> 03:51.000
-Mr. Zhang!
-Save me!

03:51.080 --> 03:54.440
If you kill him,
you'll truly never find her!

03:54.520 --> 03:55.600
Mr. Zhang!

03:57.840 --> 03:59.040
Mr. Zhang…

04:08.720 --> 04:09.920
Take him back!

04:12.040 --> 04:12.960
You're going to break my arm!

04:13.040 --> 04:15.320
Zhang Jinran, you always
pride yourself on your integrity.

04:15.400 --> 04:17.519
Do you deserve the Emperor's trust now?

04:18.399 --> 04:20.160
Slow down! Let me go!

04:20.240 --> 04:22.079
Jinran, it's been a while!

04:22.160 --> 04:23.000
GENTLE AS A BREEZE

04:28.000 --> 04:28.960
Prince Ying.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.600
Yangzhou is truly a good place.

04:35.680 --> 04:37.520
Compared to the last time
you returned from the northwest,

04:37.600 --> 04:39.760
you look much better now.

04:39.840 --> 04:42.400
Yes. But I have urgent matters today.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.120
Step aside!

04:53.920 --> 04:57.960
Jinran, I'm just here,
and you're acting like this?

04:58.480 --> 05:01.000
Do you know what your presence here means?

05:01.080 --> 05:02.000
Du Ming.

05:05.800 --> 05:09.160
The Emperor wishes to hold
a Jewel Exhibition in Yangzhou.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.280
I volunteered to attend.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.960
For such a grand event, Zheng Shiyuan,

05:14.040 --> 05:16.760
the head of Yangzhou Jewelry Guild,
must lend his full support.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.720
Could you make an exception

05:19.640 --> 05:21.400
and let him rest in his room now?

05:21.480 --> 05:23.680
Everything is still under your control.

05:23.760 --> 05:24.800
Prince Ying…

05:25.320 --> 05:28.000
For the sake
of our years of kinship, please.

05:28.080 --> 05:31.920
Zheng Shiyuan bears several lives
and is involved in multiple major cases.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.520
If I don't arrest him today,

05:33.600 --> 05:36.800
I would betray the Emperor above
and my conscience below.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.760
-Where is Zheng Shiyuan?
-When I arrived, it was like this.

05:53.840 --> 05:54.920
He escaped. We didn't catch him.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.120
You, keep looking for him!

05:58.200 --> 05:59.280
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

06:00.200 --> 06:01.200
What's going on?

06:02.720 --> 06:03.720
Where is Zheng Shiyuan?

06:03.800 --> 06:07.480
That's what I should be asking you.
Your men brought him here!

06:07.560 --> 06:08.840
What do you mean by that?

06:08.920 --> 06:10.400
I told them to take him back to his room.

06:10.480 --> 06:12.600
The Jewel Exhibition is around the corner.
We can't do without him!

06:13.280 --> 06:16.640
But with so many men at your disposal,
you let someone take him away?

06:19.520 --> 06:21.360
Aren't you the Inspector of Huainandao?

06:21.880 --> 06:24.240
No matter what issues
exist between you two,

06:25.120 --> 06:26.440
bring him back to me!

06:38.080 --> 06:41.520
Du Ming,
arrest every single Zheng family servant.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.560
-I'll question them myself.
-Yes, sir!

07:04.000 --> 07:05.480
Still not talking, huh?

07:08.040 --> 07:09.000
Beat him harder!

07:15.160 --> 07:16.120
Mr. Zhang,

07:17.120 --> 07:19.240
he can't even take 30 strokes!

07:22.040 --> 07:23.120
Next!

07:23.800 --> 07:25.760
If they won't confess, beat them to death!

07:25.840 --> 07:27.360
You! Move!

07:27.440 --> 07:29.960
Don't drag me! I'll talk!

07:30.960 --> 07:32.320
I'll confess!

07:32.400 --> 07:35.480
This morning,
the ones who went out with the Master

07:37.360 --> 07:38.640
were those two.

07:42.400 --> 07:45.360
You two, speak! Speak!

07:45.440 --> 07:47.920
The Master's men kidnapped
Mr. Qin from the glass workshop.

07:48.000 --> 07:50.760
-He wanted to meet Su Muzhe.
-I'm asking you. Where is she?

07:50.840 --> 07:54.040
In a deep pit on Shu Hill!
The Master wanted to bury her alive!

08:14.000 --> 08:15.160
Weren't you beat unconscious?

08:15.240 --> 08:18.440
No, I wasn't. They gagged me
right after taking me out.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.520
It's over…

08:21.160 --> 08:22.400
It's over…

08:24.280 --> 08:25.360
It's all over…

08:48.480 --> 08:51.480
Where is Su Muzhe? Speak!

08:52.360 --> 08:53.440
I'm dead anyway.

08:53.520 --> 08:55.760
Having Su Muzhe
buried with me isn't so bad…

09:04.160 --> 09:05.080
Fine.

09:06.080 --> 09:07.560
I'll send you on your way right now!

09:08.200 --> 09:10.320
No… I'll talk!

09:10.400 --> 09:12.040
-Speak!
-I'll tell you…

09:12.840 --> 09:14.040
She's on Shu Hill.

09:16.400 --> 09:19.800
-Where on Shu Hill?
-On the northwest side,

09:19.880 --> 09:21.960
behind the graves of my two sons.

09:23.280 --> 09:25.400
It's true…

09:29.960 --> 09:30.880
Keep an eye on him.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.400
There!

10:15.600 --> 10:16.560
Duanwu!

10:18.280 --> 10:19.200
Duanwu!

10:20.960 --> 10:22.120
Duanwu!

10:25.840 --> 10:26.920
Yan Zijing!

10:31.320 --> 10:32.280
Duanwu!

10:33.080 --> 10:34.880
Duanwu!

10:36.080 --> 10:37.160
Duanwu!

10:53.280 --> 10:54.920
Duanwu!

10:55.000 --> 10:56.280
Here!

10:56.840 --> 10:58.160
-Quick!
-Hurry!

11:35.680 --> 11:36.920
You're finally here.

11:37.000 --> 11:38.320
Where is Su Muzhe?

11:38.400 --> 11:39.720
It's been so long.

11:39.800 --> 11:42.480
Even if Yan Zijing finds her,
he'll only find a corpse.

11:42.560 --> 11:45.120
Get me out of here, quickly!

11:48.240 --> 11:49.280
Hurry!

12:02.040 --> 12:03.280
Zheng Shiyuan!

12:04.440 --> 12:05.520
Come out!

12:25.880 --> 12:26.920
Where is he?

12:28.360 --> 12:30.680
-I… I don't know.
-You don't know?

12:31.480 --> 12:33.640
I really don't know!

12:36.800 --> 12:37.800
Where is Zheng Shiyuan?

12:39.160 --> 12:40.120
We don't know.

12:40.200 --> 12:43.280
-We don't know!
-We really don't!

12:43.360 --> 12:45.200
Drag them all away.

12:46.320 --> 12:47.560
Question them one by one.

12:48.760 --> 12:50.600
If Zheng Shiyuan isn't caught today,

12:51.840 --> 12:53.680
they'll join Su Muzhe in the afterlife!

12:53.760 --> 12:56.040
-Have mercy!
-Move!

12:57.400 --> 12:59.480
-I really don't know!
-We really don't!

13:22.360 --> 13:23.840
-Greetings, Prince Ying.
-Greetings, Prince Ying.

13:27.760 --> 13:30.320
Thank you, Li Kui,
for traveling so far to Yangzhou

13:30.400 --> 13:32.440
and even cleaning up
the Zheng family's mess.

13:32.520 --> 13:34.000
-Prince Ying…
-Master Zheng,

13:34.080 --> 13:35.520
over the years,

13:35.600 --> 13:38.080
Prince Ying has gone
to great lengths to help you.

13:38.160 --> 13:40.560
He's eliminated
countless competitors for you,

13:40.640 --> 13:42.920
even wiping out the Cui family.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.360
And yet you…

13:44.440 --> 13:46.560
Now, you can't even return home.

13:46.640 --> 13:48.920
Isn't this all thanks
to your brilliant schemes?

13:49.440 --> 13:51.880
If I hadn't cleaned up
after you time and again,

13:51.960 --> 13:53.440
Yan Zijing would've killed you long ago.

13:53.520 --> 13:55.360
You've brought ruin to my Zheng family,

13:55.440 --> 13:56.880
and you still dare claim
you're helping me?

13:56.960 --> 14:00.480
If I wanted to ruin the Zheng family,
I would've ruined you first.

14:01.600 --> 14:03.680
What use is keeping your sons?

14:03.760 --> 14:06.080
You'd better worry about yourself.

14:06.600 --> 14:07.960
After Su Muzhe's death,

14:08.040 --> 14:09.880
Zhang Jinran and Yan Zijing

14:09.960 --> 14:12.720
will surely go mad
and seek revenge on you.

14:13.240 --> 14:14.280
Enough.

14:14.360 --> 14:16.680
We're all in the same boat now.

14:18.440 --> 14:19.760
Let's focus on how to handle this mess.

14:19.840 --> 14:22.280
What happens here should be resolved here.

14:22.360 --> 14:24.440
The priority will be uniting
the two pearls

14:24.520 --> 14:28.440
to unveil the long-lost Gulistan treasure.

14:28.520 --> 14:30.600
The next step is in your hands, Li Kui.

14:32.400 --> 14:34.200
Your Highness,
Zhang Jinran has sealed the city.

14:34.280 --> 14:35.160
He's conducting a nighttime search.

14:38.280 --> 14:39.360
Prince Ying.

14:41.920 --> 14:44.080
CLEAR MIND

14:59.680 --> 15:00.720
Yingtao!

15:15.560 --> 15:16.600
My lady,

15:17.360 --> 15:18.520
everyone…

15:20.880 --> 15:23.400
It's alright. I know everything now.
It's alright.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.160
The news yesterday was true.

15:33.680 --> 15:35.480
Su Muzhe has indeed been kidnapped,

15:35.560 --> 15:36.920
and now she's dead.

15:47.680 --> 15:49.280
Thank you, ladies.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.440
Follow me inside.

15:59.640 --> 16:01.960
My lady, are you going to mourn Su Muzhe?

16:06.680 --> 16:08.320
If I went to mourn her,

16:09.160 --> 16:11.200
she might just come back to life
out of spite.

16:31.160 --> 16:33.160
-Zheng Shiyuan did it?
-Yes.

16:33.760 --> 16:35.480
Inspector Zhang went
to the Zheng family's house last night.

16:35.560 --> 16:38.080
He didn't find him,
so he ordered a citywide search.

16:40.920 --> 16:44.000
Keep watching the Zheng family closely.
Don't let anything slip.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.000
Yes, madam.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.760
My lady, have some water to cool down.

16:58.720 --> 17:00.400
It's not me who's dead.

17:00.480 --> 17:01.720
Why would I be angry?

17:04.680 --> 17:07.400
Su Muzhe fought with the Zheng family
for so long,

17:08.240 --> 17:11.160
even Zheng Wu suffered
many losses against her.

17:12.560 --> 17:13.839
And now she's just gone?

17:14.359 --> 17:16.200
Zheng Shiyuan has always been ruthless,

17:16.720 --> 17:18.520
and he clearly has powerful allies
backing him.

17:18.599 --> 17:20.240
Su Muzhe was bound to lose against him.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.480
Lose?

17:32.320 --> 17:33.480
Su Muzhe,

17:35.040 --> 17:37.880
once I send Zheng Shiyuan
to the depths of hell,

17:39.400 --> 17:41.760
I might come to offer you my condolences.

18:43.400 --> 18:44.240
For this incident,

18:45.440 --> 18:47.080
how does Clear Mind plan to respond?

18:57.320 --> 19:00.760
Without Ms. Su,
there would be no Duckweed Society.

19:01.920 --> 19:03.480
There's little else we can do,

19:03.560 --> 19:06.440
but let's make the funeral

19:06.520 --> 19:08.320
as grand as possible!

19:08.400 --> 19:10.160
We must let everyone know

19:10.240 --> 19:12.880
how much Ms. Su suffered
at the hands of the Zheng family.

19:15.000 --> 19:18.520
In the past, we fought tooth and nail

19:18.600 --> 19:20.240
to cling to the powerful.

19:20.320 --> 19:24.040
Only Ms. Su gave us

19:24.120 --> 19:26.240
a wake-up call.

19:26.320 --> 19:28.800
She united all us.

19:28.880 --> 19:31.880
She told us we can achieve
great things without pleasing others.

19:34.560 --> 19:36.160
With Clear Mind,

19:36.680 --> 19:39.200
Duckweed Society found its foundation.

19:40.320 --> 19:41.720
But now…

19:49.600 --> 19:52.680
Yingtao, pull yourself together.

19:53.600 --> 19:57.160
Think about how much Ms. Su
valued you when she was still here.

20:02.680 --> 20:04.160
Ms. Su!

20:05.920 --> 20:07.560
Ms. Su!

20:08.400 --> 20:10.200
Ms. Su!

20:11.640 --> 20:13.240
Ms. Su!

20:17.120 --> 20:20.120
How could you
just leave like this, Ms. Su?

20:25.720 --> 20:26.880
Ladies,

20:28.000 --> 20:29.640
thank you all for coming today.

20:31.160 --> 20:33.480
Clear Mind was Ms. Su's labor of love,

20:34.080 --> 20:35.760
and it's also the foundation
for all of us.

20:36.520 --> 20:37.840
I promise to protect it.

20:42.440 --> 20:45.000
Ms. Su always shielded me.

20:46.040 --> 20:47.680
In this world,

20:48.560 --> 20:51.720
she's the closest
and most important person to me.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.440
I know you all share my grief,

20:56.520 --> 20:58.360
but right now, what's most important

20:58.960 --> 21:00.640
is doing something for Ms. Su!

21:01.480 --> 21:03.800
-We must avenge her!
-I want to avenge Ms. Su!

21:14.440 --> 21:16.320
I ask you all, ladies,

21:17.400 --> 21:20.000
to help us find
Zheng Shiyuan's whereabouts.

21:21.080 --> 21:24.440
Let's find him soon and avenge Ms. Su.

21:25.040 --> 21:27.280
Ladies, please help us.

21:27.360 --> 21:29.000
Help us avenge Ms. Su.

21:29.080 --> 21:30.160
Thank you, ladies.

21:31.400 --> 21:33.400
Please, ladies, help us…

21:49.280 --> 21:50.440
NOTICE

21:50.520 --> 21:54.480
Inspector Zhang of Huainandao
announces to the people of Yangzhou.

21:55.280 --> 21:59.280
Former Official Xu Nanying
of the Yangzhou Grand Governor's Office,

21:59.360 --> 22:02.360
colluding with the Black Dragon Bandits
and murdering innocents,

22:02.440 --> 22:05.080
will be executed tomorrow
for public display!

22:06.760 --> 22:08.520
Execution for public display!

22:09.080 --> 22:09.960
Justice served!

22:17.320 --> 22:18.640
Has Zhang Jinran gone mad?

22:18.720 --> 22:19.960
What nerve!

22:20.040 --> 22:23.160
Xu Nanying, Official of Yangzhou,
holds the rank of Third-Class Official.

22:23.240 --> 22:25.800
Who gave him the authority
to publicly execute Xu Nanying?

22:25.880 --> 22:29.880
The Zhang Jinran of the past
would never act so impulsively.

22:29.960 --> 22:35.320
But with Su Muzhe dead,
he and Yan Zijing are unpredictable now.

22:35.400 --> 22:38.240
Cut off what needs to be cut off promptly.

22:38.320 --> 22:41.680
Zheng Shiyuan is insignificant,
but Xu Nanying cannot die yet.

22:43.160 --> 22:44.560
He's merely a pawn.

22:44.640 --> 22:47.280
Why do you care?

22:53.920 --> 22:56.000
Your Highness, someone shot this letter
into the courtyard with an arrow.

22:56.080 --> 22:57.720
I took men to pursue him, but he vanished.

22:57.800 --> 22:59.680
-Leave.
-Yes.

23:20.840 --> 23:22.600
If Xu dies,

23:22.680 --> 23:26.200
all past dealings will come to light.

23:27.560 --> 23:28.720
Who sent this?

23:29.920 --> 23:31.680
And why is he threatening you?

23:32.600 --> 23:36.000
Xu Nanying intercepted
a letter exchanged between us

23:36.760 --> 23:39.640
and entrusted it to his servant, Xu Lin.

23:39.720 --> 23:44.440
Back then,
he betrayed Prince Tan and joined me.

23:44.520 --> 23:46.120
I reluctantly took him in.

23:46.880 --> 23:50.560
This threatening letter
must have been sent by Xu Lin.

23:51.320 --> 23:54.360
If this letter is exposed,
it'll be trouble.

23:56.560 --> 23:59.600
I suspect Zhang Jinran
forced some information out of Xu Nanying,

24:00.200 --> 24:04.400
so he plans to use executing him
to stage this trap.

24:06.760 --> 24:10.640
But my men's every move
is under his control.

24:14.800 --> 24:18.800
Li Kui, your Black Dragon Bandits
might not be as easy for him to track.

24:18.880 --> 24:21.560
So, you already knew it was a trap.

24:21.640 --> 24:24.440
You refused to jump in yourself
and now want me to?

24:24.520 --> 24:26.760
Zhang Jinran has gone mad.
You admitted it yourself just now.

24:27.440 --> 24:31.280
If we ignore this,
they might really kill Xu Nanying.

24:31.360 --> 24:33.320
If you can save Xu Nanying,

24:34.000 --> 24:36.720
I'll find a way to intercept Xu Lin,
who they're trying to lure out.

24:36.800 --> 24:38.360
Then we'll be safe.

24:38.440 --> 24:42.040
Didn't you also say just now
that your identity is no longer a secret?

24:42.120 --> 24:44.400
Exposing it won't change the situation.

24:44.480 --> 24:47.760
Aren't you afraid
I'll fall into his hands too,

24:47.840 --> 24:48.920
and you'll lose another round?

24:49.000 --> 24:51.120
You're exceptionally skilled,

24:51.840 --> 24:53.720
and your subordinates are all experts.

24:53.800 --> 24:55.440
You'll surely escape unharmed.

24:55.520 --> 24:57.080
Once Xu Lin is eliminated,

24:57.640 --> 25:01.160
I'll report Zhang Jinran's
illegal execution to the Emperor.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.800
He'll be finished.

25:02.880 --> 25:06.200
At that point, you can return to the West
to seek your Gulistan treasure

25:06.280 --> 25:07.840
and live openly and freely.

25:08.840 --> 25:09.960
What do you think?

25:10.760 --> 25:12.200
You've hidden in the shadows for 20 years.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.600
Do you plan to hide for another 20?

25:18.040 --> 25:18.920
Fine.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.960
I'll make one last move for you.

25:24.920 --> 25:26.400
I toast you with tea instead of wine.

25:27.680 --> 25:31.200
May you achieve swift success.

25:32.080 --> 25:33.280
Last meal. Eat quickly.

25:33.360 --> 25:35.720
What do you mean? Is this for me?

25:35.800 --> 25:37.280
This can't be for me, right?

25:37.800 --> 25:39.040
Eat your fill before you set off.

25:39.120 --> 25:41.480
Zhang Jinran!

25:42.000 --> 25:44.320
What are you going to do to me?

25:44.400 --> 25:48.480
I'm Xu Nanying, Official
of the Yangzhou Grand Governor's Office!

25:48.560 --> 25:49.760
You can't treat me like this!

25:50.800 --> 25:52.160
You can't do this to me!

25:52.240 --> 25:55.600
Zhang Jinran, I demand to see the Emperor!

25:55.680 --> 25:58.400
You're ruthless to your senior,

25:58.480 --> 26:00.800
ignoring the bonds of our sect!

26:00.880 --> 26:02.760
You pervert justice for personal gain!

26:02.840 --> 26:05.360
You collude and persecute!

26:05.440 --> 26:07.560
I want to see Xu Lin!

26:07.640 --> 26:10.160
Xu Lin, save me!

27:02.400 --> 27:03.400
Ambush!

27:09.280 --> 27:10.640
Protect the prisoner!

27:10.720 --> 27:12.000
Protect the prisoner!

27:17.600 --> 27:18.600
Charge!

27:49.360 --> 27:51.160
-Kill!
-Kill!

27:51.240 --> 27:52.080
Go!

28:04.680 --> 28:06.080
Go!

28:15.600 --> 28:16.560
Stay back!

28:17.080 --> 28:18.160
What are you doing?

28:18.680 --> 28:20.600
Do you think
I care whether he lives or dies?

28:21.440 --> 28:22.920
As long as he's dead,

28:23.000 --> 28:25.880
the letter Xu Lin holds
will naturally be made public.

28:25.960 --> 28:27.160
You can't kill me!

28:27.240 --> 28:30.200
Weren't you sent here to save me?

29:32.280 --> 29:33.600
You're Li Kui!

30:26.280 --> 30:29.800
Father!

30:42.040 --> 30:43.880
Yuchi, long time no see.

30:43.960 --> 30:45.520
Back then, you were only this tall.

30:45.600 --> 30:47.480
Come here. Let me hug you!

30:49.040 --> 30:50.400
You're too heavy to lift now!

30:52.360 --> 30:53.640
Yuchi Wuyi…

31:00.360 --> 31:01.520
You're Li Kui?

31:02.360 --> 31:04.120
I've been extra cautious,

31:05.440 --> 31:06.760
and yet you still found out.

31:08.560 --> 31:10.080
I should've killed you

31:10.600 --> 31:13.560
along with your entire family back then.

31:13.640 --> 31:16.320
I thought I could use you one day.

31:20.480 --> 31:22.080
I was asking for trouble.

31:37.680 --> 31:39.600
You said that we shared the same pain,

31:41.640 --> 31:43.160
that our fates were similar,

31:45.840 --> 31:49.240
and you spared no effort to help me,
supporting me,

31:53.240 --> 31:55.040
making me treat you like a brother.

32:09.280 --> 32:10.760
It turns out you did all of this

32:13.720 --> 32:15.440
just to win my trust,

32:17.160 --> 32:18.560
to make me help you find
the blood-stained pearl.

32:20.680 --> 32:22.600
I was trapped in Black Dragon Cave
for so many years,

32:25.200 --> 32:27.440
and yet I never realized you were Li Kui.

32:27.520 --> 32:28.880
I know

32:30.440 --> 32:32.720
you hate me to the bone now

32:34.040 --> 32:35.640
and want to tear me to pieces,

32:35.720 --> 32:36.600
but…

32:37.600 --> 32:39.160
if I die,

32:40.760 --> 32:42.600
no one can cure your poison.

32:43.120 --> 32:44.680
The Black Dragon Cave has burned down.

32:44.760 --> 32:46.240
The Black Dragon Spring has dried up.

32:46.320 --> 32:47.560
In this entire world,

32:49.400 --> 32:51.720
only I can make your antidote.

32:57.280 --> 32:58.800
I don't want your antidote.

33:04.560 --> 33:05.520
I only want you dead!

33:20.320 --> 33:21.680
Don't kill him yet.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.880
Move aside!

33:27.960 --> 33:29.640
He has the antidote.
Don't you value your life?

33:34.600 --> 33:35.600
Yan Zijing…

33:37.360 --> 33:38.640
Zijing…

33:54.560 --> 33:55.560
Kill him!

34:05.440 --> 34:08.000
Kangju, kill him…

34:12.080 --> 34:13.719
The antidote… The antidote…

34:17.280 --> 34:18.280
The antidote!

35:11.600 --> 35:12.960
I'll pour you some water.

35:39.480 --> 35:41.480
My poison keeps acting up these days.

35:44.000 --> 35:45.080
My eyesight…

35:45.800 --> 35:47.120
I often can't see things clearly.

35:51.280 --> 35:52.400
It'll be fine.

35:53.560 --> 35:58.160
Now that we know Yuchi Wuyi is Li Kui,
we'll definitely catch him.

35:58.680 --> 36:00.160
We'll get the antidote for sure.

36:03.320 --> 36:05.160
I really was blind.

36:06.640 --> 36:09.040
All these years,
I never realized he was Li Kui.

36:14.320 --> 36:15.760
We must capture him.

36:17.320 --> 36:21.160
I'll use his life
to honor the spirits of my Yan family.

36:23.520 --> 36:25.120
We'll definitely catch him.

36:29.800 --> 36:32.640
-Liu, this is for your child.
-Thank you.

36:32.720 --> 36:34.800
Liu, Xu Nanying
of the Grand Governor's Office…

36:34.880 --> 36:36.640
-Here are your buns.
-Xu Nanying?

36:36.720 --> 36:39.360
The one who colluded
with the Black Dragon Bandits?

36:39.440 --> 36:41.360
Wasn't he supposed to be executed today?

36:41.880 --> 36:44.400
I heard someone assassinated him.

36:44.920 --> 36:45.800
Really?

36:46.880 --> 36:48.200
Prince Ying
is pursuing suspicious bandits.

36:48.280 --> 36:49.160
Move aside!

36:49.240 --> 36:50.160
Out of the way!

36:52.360 --> 36:53.960
Prince Ying is pursuing
suspicious bandits?

36:54.040 --> 36:56.000
Why are they heading
toward the Grand Governor's Office?

36:58.960 --> 36:59.800
Take care.

37:10.880 --> 37:14.840
To Li Kui. The Yan family
colluded with Kang and the court's nobles.

37:14.920 --> 37:16.320
They aimed to open commerce
with the Western Regions,

37:16.400 --> 37:18.440
seeking unprecedented achievements
and everlasting benefits.

37:18.520 --> 37:19.680
If the Yan family succeeds,

37:19.760 --> 37:21.640
both I and Prince Tan
will lose His Majesty's favor,

37:21.720 --> 37:22.920
you will lose your advantage,

37:23.520 --> 37:26.320
and the Zheng and Cui families
will have no foothold in Yangzhou.

37:26.400 --> 37:29.000
Therefore, Prince Tan
has sent the Cuis as the vanguard,

37:29.080 --> 37:30.560
and I've ordered the Zhengs
to handle the aftermath.

37:30.640 --> 37:32.680
You can show us your full potential.

37:36.880 --> 37:40.520
How did you know I have evidence?

37:41.560 --> 37:43.520
Xu Nanying didn't bring you to Yangzhou

37:44.120 --> 37:46.120
because he gave you
the evidence of Prince Ying's crimes

37:46.720 --> 37:48.400
as his lifeline.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.400
I ordered Xu Nanying's execution

37:50.480 --> 37:52.480
first, to draw out
the Black Dragon Bandits,

37:53.080 --> 37:55.520
and second, to lure you out.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.680
With just a few words,

37:57.760 --> 38:00.880
and they managed to brush off
you useless lot?

38:09.040 --> 38:10.560
There was no execution ground,

38:12.360 --> 38:14.160
no beheading.

38:30.600 --> 38:32.280
What's wrong with you, Li Kui?

38:33.960 --> 38:35.360
I failed.

38:38.360 --> 38:39.480
Xu Nanying is dead.

38:43.960 --> 38:46.120
Would you fail so easily?

38:48.280 --> 38:49.840
Or was it just for show?

38:53.160 --> 38:54.560
Are you doubting me?

38:58.000 --> 38:59.200
You're overthinking it.

38:59.840 --> 39:03.720
I'll find the best doctor to treat you,
so you can recover completely.

39:04.880 --> 39:05.880
No need.

39:06.400 --> 39:08.000
It's just a minor injury.

39:08.080 --> 39:09.800
I can treat it myself.

39:11.200 --> 39:12.080
By the way,

39:13.440 --> 39:15.040
may I ask, Li Kui,

39:16.120 --> 39:17.760
the treasured pearl,

39:18.640 --> 39:19.520
is it safe?

39:24.640 --> 39:27.000
So, you were never interested in me

39:28.000 --> 39:28.880
but in the pearl all along.

39:33.720 --> 39:35.080
All this time,

39:36.200 --> 39:39.400
the Black Dragon Bandits were just pawns
on your chessboard.

39:39.480 --> 39:40.520
Isn't that right?

39:41.760 --> 39:45.280
You have always been
the one I relied on most.

39:46.280 --> 39:48.120
I'm just glad you returned safely.

39:48.640 --> 39:49.880
Take your time recovering.

39:50.560 --> 39:51.800
The future is bright.

39:54.640 --> 39:55.800
The future is bright.

40:12.920 --> 40:15.800
Li Kui, undefeated in the northwest,

40:16.320 --> 40:17.720
has suffered a loss today.

40:18.400 --> 40:20.920
It seems he won't rise again.

40:33.800 --> 40:36.680
Second Master, Third Master, Lady Shijiu,

40:36.760 --> 40:38.120
the Master isn't home.

40:38.200 --> 40:41.080
If you have any business,
please come back another day.

40:41.160 --> 40:42.040
Insolence!

40:42.560 --> 40:43.680
Whether to receive guests

40:43.760 --> 40:45.680
is not for mere servants
like you to decide!

40:47.280 --> 40:51.160
-I'm just a servant.
-Second Uncle, Third Uncle,

40:51.240 --> 40:53.960
Uncle is involved in a major case.

40:54.040 --> 40:56.880
You are esteemed elders of the family,

40:56.960 --> 40:58.480
standing righteously by my side,

40:58.560 --> 41:01.280
yet you can't even get past the door now.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.840
What should we do?

41:02.920 --> 41:04.240
Before the Master left,

41:04.320 --> 41:06.840
he specifically instructed me
not to let outsiders in.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.400
Are we outsiders?

41:08.920 --> 41:11.920
We brothers couldn't bear
to see the Zheng family in chaos.

41:12.000 --> 41:13.000
Exactly!

41:13.080 --> 41:14.880
We came to help our elder brother.

41:14.960 --> 41:18.520
Even though Zheng Si and Zheng Wu
made grave mistakes before,

41:18.600 --> 41:20.760
no proper funeral rites were held.

41:20.840 --> 41:22.680
Their memorial tablets haven't
even been placed in the ancestral hall.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.680
If this spreads,

41:23.760 --> 41:25.120
what will outsiders think
of the Zheng family?

41:25.640 --> 41:28.720
Those who understand may sympathize
with our elder brother's grief.

41:28.800 --> 41:31.640
Those who don't,
will think he's cold and heartless.

41:31.720 --> 41:34.880
As brothers,
how can we sit by and do nothing?

41:35.880 --> 41:36.840
But…

41:38.320 --> 41:41.520
Esteemed elders, please take charge.

41:42.040 --> 41:44.680
Please open the ancestral hall
and place the memorial tablets.

41:44.760 --> 41:46.760
Masters, this must not be done!

41:46.840 --> 41:48.280
-It mustn't!
-Are you deaf?

41:48.360 --> 41:49.360
-Get out of the way!
-Open the ancestral hall!

41:51.200 --> 41:52.800
This… This mustn't be done!

41:52.880 --> 41:54.320
-It's not allowed!
-It's not allowed!

41:54.400 --> 41:55.720
It mustn't be done!

41:56.240 --> 41:58.520
It mustn't be done!

42:04.400 --> 42:06.480
It mustn't be done!

42:06.560 --> 42:08.200
It mustn't!

42:23.400 --> 42:24.800
It's not allowed…
